MusicBrainz
  Artist records and relationships are fetched from the MusicBrainz web
  service. MusicBrainz core data is released into the public domain under
  CC0 1.0 Universal; supplementary data (such as genre tags) is licensed
  CC BY-NC-SA 3.0. MusicBrainz is operated by the MetaBrainz Foundation.
  https://musicbrainz.org/doc/About/Data_License

